", "createTime": 1761234562, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "411558284_847wn6uPZ", "userVid": 411558284, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 411558284, "name": "墨染星辰", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-8Hx_xCU9xULKvKTMII~7Bf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "阅读", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "唯情怀可渡世间薄凉！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240715-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}}]}, {"range": "10670-10703", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 5, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "13628525_8aYZdjFQY", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "​​为什么产能滞后于价格​​\n• 投资者往往先根据当期需求和价格信号决定是否扩产；但新产能从决策到建成往往需要 ​​3–5 年​​，甚至更长。因此，当价格已经反映短期供需缺口时，产能仍停留在上一轮周期的水平，形成“当期需求—当期价格—滞后产能”的结构。\n• 产能形成的时滞使得“需求—供给”在时间上错配：需求突然上升→价格立刻上涨→产能在若干年后才跟上，于是价格在先行指标中率先见顶，而产能在滞后指标中随后才达到新的均衡。\n​​产能滞后带来的周期波动​​\n• 由于产能更新慢，一旦需求持续扩张，价格会先快速攀升，随后才逐渐传导为新增供给；反之，需求一旦回落，价格会迅速下跌，而过剩产能仍需数年才能被淘汰。这种“先行—滞后”关系正是大宗商品价格剧烈波动、并经常出现“越涨越缺”或“越跌越产”的根本原因。\n• 由此，产能周期被视为解释 ​​50–60 年康波​​中价格长期波动的重要入手点，尽管它无法单独预测全部长波，但能帮助判断大类资产在周期中的位置。\n​​对投资与宏观分析的启示​​\n• ​​投资者​​：当观察到价格已出现明显上涨而行业产能指标仍低位时，应意识到扩产的回报期在数年后才能兑现；相反，价格急跌但产能迟迟不减，则意味着底部修复可能拖得较久。\n• ​​宏观政策​​：产能滞后意味着仅靠价格信号难以及时纠偏供需失衡，政府或行业协会在需求高企时往往需要提前引导产能规划，以减少未来波动。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "产能是价格的滞后指标", "range": "10692-10702", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "13628525_8aYZdjFQY", "userVid": 13628525, "topics": [], "createTime": 1785401086, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 13628525, "name": "CYY", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIycvWkSOaMVL8vMyd9EdascG7JlsQK6yHyVWfbrRndk79224bYu8kt3UsLfdOeH0OE2YO84m2OKWolb65VOl0mIuUS0tN5INZHMg6SlEhAyQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-50", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 50}}}, "likesCount": 6}, {"reviewId": "254854030_884Yqt3Zc", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "价格上涨时企业看到有利可图才会投资扩产，但从建设到投产要好几年，所以价格早就高位很久了，新增供给才姗姗来迟；价格下跌时企业亏损严重才会停止生产关闭产能，同样不会立刻减少供给，也是滞后很久才收缩。整个过程中价格是主动的即时变化的，产能是被动的延迟反应的，这就是它永远滞后于价格的根本原因，也正是这种滞后不断造成供需错配让大宗商品暴涨暴跌。\n比如铜价大涨的时候价格立刻上去，但产能两三年后才增加，等产能真正变多的时候价格往往已经跌了。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "需要注意的是，价格与产能的关系是相互推动的，产能是价格的滞后指标。", "range": "10670-10703", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "254854030_884Yqt3Zc", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775176322, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 10}, {"reviewId": "30474951_8czpSy5KC", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "不能拿产能数据去预判当下价格拐点。产能更多用来验证行情，属于后验信号。如果只盯着产能数据，容易错过底部，或是在产能过剩阶段误判反转。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "10670-10703", "abstract": "需要注意的是，价格与产能的关系是相互推动的，产能是价格的滞后指标。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "30474951_8czpSy5KC", "userVid": 30474951, "topics": [], "createTime": 1790991937, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 30474951, "name": "Damon", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/m7VoNXYdu8uuuBq0Hg3OLD5wvzpTEG2fbn1jYiatxNUramnUWAT2tmrKjmGrEOr0veQpIxfx1B6P72V3yLckvKQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "行有所得，反求诸己", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}}, {"reviewId": "3183165_8adsdxZQi", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "价格是因，产能是果", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "价格与产能的关系是相互推动的，产能是价格的滞后指标。", "range": "10677-10703", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "3183165_8adsdxZQi", "userVid": 3183165, "topics": [], "createTime": 1782701245, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 3183165, "name": "Chan", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0Lx53tbXl5m4uHibjMfo7AvyxJ11bIniabI8xOa7qwf5SiaYGcjENQQL7xkeGEpAMW5TcMVqzCExZN7B96QFyYcnF6xd1iaohgZdjeicZ4RaVo4E/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "384484875_88Cr4U5qq", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "就是大家看到有利可图了，一股子涌入进去，但是建设到生产需要一定的周期，这个周期确实有一定的利润，当产能上来之后，就形成竞争，价格就下来了，从而也倒逼生产厂家开始降本增效。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "10670-10703", "abstract": "需要注意的是，价格与产能的关系是相互推动的，产能是价格的滞后指标。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "384484875_88Cr4U5qq", "userVid": 384484875, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777076979, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 384484875, "name": "阿鱼", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJJFpbr7XNEU9LPy5koHIk1QoknDSxiciad8zGpJvPOojdYibNXKgrpeCMGtdmT8symbEAdsfbhQwTbj0437Q9bDLbFzvjeysAzibTaDYNtGdcjtg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "阿鱼", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 3}]}, {"range": "10787-10825", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_884YPMCNB", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "1. 产能指数同比：\n衡量当前工业生产线实际开动的比例，是满负荷生产、半开工还是停工，反映当下真实的产能利用程度，越高说明生产越忙、供给越紧张。\n2. 固定资产形成同比：\n指整个国家一年内真正变成厂房、设备、产线的实物资产总量，衡量的是已经实实在在变成产能的部分，是已经落地的产能。\n3. 固定资产投资同比：\n指企业投出去的钱，用于建工厂、买设备、扩产的资金总额，它代表正在建设、未来会变成产能的部分，是最领先最能预示未来供给的指标。\n4. 固定资产平均使用时间：\n就是设备、厂房用了多少年，时间越长说明设备越老旧、产能效率越低、快要淘汰或需要更新，反映产能是老化还是年轻。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "产能指数同比、固定资产形成同比、固定资产投资同比、固定资产平均使用时间", "range": "10790-10825", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "254854030_884YPMCNB", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775176696, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 9}, {"reviewId": "14755045_87uO0axrW", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "一、四个指标的含义\n1. 固定资产平均使用时间\n• ​​定义​​：将所有在产设备按其占净固定资产的比重加权，计算出的平均已使用年限。它通过反映“设备有多旧”来间接刻画产能结构。\n• ​​长周期含义​​：当平均年龄上升，意味着前期投资偏少、折旧占主导，对应产能下降阶段；平均年龄下降，则往往预示新投资启动、产能上升。该指标对 ​​20～30 年的长趋势​​最为敏感，可视为捕捉产能长波的“温度计”。\n• ​​价格联系​​：平均年龄上升阶段往往伴随商品价格下行；下降阶段则与价格上涨相伴。\n​​2. 产能指数同比​​\n• ​​含义​​：反映美国各行业产能利用率的同比变化，是衡量设备在短期内被实际动用的比例。\n• ​​特点​​：对 ​​3～10 年的中周期​​反应灵敏，更多体现当前供需缺口带来的产能调动，因此常被当作景气同步指标。\n​​3. 固定资产形成同比​​\n• ​​含义​​：衡量企业在一定时期内新增固定资产的增速（即“形成”投资）。\n• ​​特点​​：形成投资是产能扩张的“起点”，其节奏与未来 ​​2～5 年的供给增量​​高度相关，是连接长波与中周期的桥梁。\n​​4. 固定资产投资同比​​\n• ​​含义​​：反映企业固定资产投资（更新+新增）的同比增速。\n• ​​特点​​：与产能指数一样，对 ​​3～10 年的中周期​​最为直接；当投资增速触顶回落，往往预示中周期见顶。固定资产投资的高点与低点通常比产能指数更频繁，可用来捕捉中周期的拐点。\n\n​​二、四指标的互补关系​​\n1. ​​短—长结合​​：固定资产投资同比/产能指数同比侧重 ​​3～10 年​​；固定资产平均使用时间则揭示 ​​10～30 年​​的大趋势，两者合用可避免只看“波段”而忽视“长潮”。\n2. ​​投资—形成—产能​​：形成投资先于固定资产投资，再通过产能利用率体现到产出。三条中短周期曲线的峰值、谷值依次滞后，可用来重建产能的完整脉络。\n3. ​​方向一致、时点不同​​：在 ​​20～30 年的长波​​里，平均使用时间的拐点往往领先于固定资产投资和产能利用率的拐点，因此可作为提前信号。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "美国的产能指数同比、固定资产形成同比、固定资产投资同比、固定资产平均使用时间", "range": "10787-10825", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "14755045_87uO0axrW", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773121963, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}}, "likesCount": 4}]}, {"range": "10950-10970", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_884ZobLtf", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "中周期（朱格拉周期）一般是8-10 年，主要跟着设备投资、企业盈利、信贷周期走，反映的是经济短期波动带来的投资变化。今年好就多投，明年差就少投，波动比较快。而大宗商品的产能周期，比如矿山、油井、冶炼厂，从决定投资到真正达产要5-10年，从产能扩张到过剩再到彻底出清，整个一轮下来要15-20年甚至更久，它的节奏远远慢于中周期，不会因为经济一好一坏就改变，也不会跟着短期投资波动而快速调整。由此可见商品产能周期时间更长、节奏更慢、惯性更大、不受短期经济波动左右，是比中周期更底层、更长的力量，这也是为什么商品价格能出现持续几年的大涨或大跌而不是跟着经济小波动起伏。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "商品的产能周期一定是超越中周期范围的", "range": "10951-10969", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "254854030_884ZobLtf", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775177204, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8chONmWBb", "review": {"abstract": "，商品的产能周期一定是超越中周期范围的，", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "产出缺口拐头向上了，但是此时产能还是过剩，产能周期还没有到底，产能周期＞中周期", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "10950-10970", "createTime": 1789992360, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "426066534_8chONmWBb", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "11790-11812", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "296764379_80pSdpiQQ", "review": {"abstract": "用固定资产的平均使用时间衡量商品的产能周期", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "折旧？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "11790-11811", "createTime": 1748190520, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "296764379_80pSdpiQQ", "userVid": 296764379, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠