"M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}}, "likesCount": 7}]}, {"range": "11833-11924", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "5687777_7XMWrWaEp", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "固定资产平均使用时间的变化是由过去的投资和折旧的速率决定的", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11840-11924", "abstract": "，即Fix(t)=Fix(t-1)+Gross Investment(t)-Depreciationor Consumption of fixed capital(t)", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "reviewId": "5687777_7XMWrWaEp", "userVid": 5687777, "topics": [], "createTime": 1738935961, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 16, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 5687777, "name": "清风", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-t1b0bKXYnMpDubnkMCiCW99/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "清风", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不知道自己不知道", "medalInfo": {"id": "M11-0-10", "desc": "点评书籍", "title": "点评书籍", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "5687777_7XMWpUQmh", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "固定资产平均使用时间基于所有在产设备的加权平均使用时间，权重是每部分固定资产占总净固定资产的份额", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11833-11924", "abstract": "净固定资产数据，即Fix(t)=Fix(t-1)+Gross Investment(t)-Depreciationor Consumption of fixed capital(t)", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "reviewId": "5687777_7XMWpUQmh", "userVid": 5687777, "topics": [], "createTime": 1738935931, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type"